---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/tee-portrait.png';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title={SITE.name}>
  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
      <div class="intro">
        <p class="hello">Hello, I'm Tee.</p>
        <h1 id="intro-title">I build AI systems and help shape the business they serve.</h1>
        <p class="lede">I'm an engineer and father of two based in Bangkok. At Chemical Express, I build software and AI systems, work with the people using them and help make decisions about the business. I'm involved in everything from writing code to developing partnerships.</p>
        <p class="welcome">This is where I write about that work and the life around it. You'll find the systems I've built, the decisions behind them, and stories about studying overseas, running a café and becoming a father.</p>
        <div class="intro-links"><a href="#selected-work">Explore my work</a><a href="/story/">Read my story</a></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="portrait">
        <Image src={portrait} alt="Tee Lakkhananukun smiling, wearing a navy blazer and white shirt." widths={[320, 480, 720]} sizes="(max-width: 700px) 230px, (max-width: 1000px) 30vw, 340px" width={720} format="webp" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        <figcaption>Chatchawan Lakkhananukun<span>Engineer, business builder, father.</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section id="selected-work" class="selected-work" aria-labelledby="work-h">
      <header class="section-intro">
        <p class="label">Selected work at Chemical Express</p>
        <h2 id="work-h">The systems, and what it took to make them useful</h2>
        <p>A chemical distributor's work connects customers, suppliers, products and people. These two projects grew from understanding those connections and building around the way the business actually works.</p>
      </header>
      <article class="featured-project">
        <div class="project-story">
          <p class="project-name">QT AI Agents</p>
          <h3><a href="/work/quoting-ai/">There is more to a quote than finding a price</a></h3>
          <p>A customer asks for a laboratory product. Before we can offer it, someone needs to understand the requirements, find the right variant and check the price. I built QT to help our team work through that process.</p>
          <p>The first release made too many product mistakes. I pulled it back, introduced product search on its own and rebuilt the workflow around what the team found useful.</p>
          <a class="story-link" href="/work/quoting-ai/">Read the QT story</a>
        </div>
        <aside class="project-context" aria-label="QT scope and results">
          <p class="context-title">In everyday use</p>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>15–30 minutes</dt><dd>Typical quotation time, including review</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Over 98%</dt><dd>Suggested products accepted unchanged by customer service</dd></div>
            <div><dt>6,000–10,000</dt><dd>Requested product lines each month</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p class="context-note">Built for 17 people. Every quotation still goes through human review.</p>
        </aside>
      </article>
      <article class="featured-project sales-feature">
        <div class="project-story">
          <p class="project-name">Sales recommendation platform</p>
          <h3><a href="/work/sales-models/">Helping sales decide who to call and why</a></h3>
          <p>Our salespeople knew their main accounts well, but opportunities elsewhere could be missed. I built a platform that brings customer history, product recommendations and business rules together to help them decide where to spend their time.</p>
          <p>The work also meant listening when a recommendation did not fit the customer, and finding out what the model was missing.</p>
          <a class="story-link" href="/work/sales-models/">Explore the sales platform</a>
        </div>
        <aside class="project-context" aria-label="Sales platform scope and reported results">
          <p class="context-title">Across 3,000 accounts</p>
          <p>Nine models work with a catalogue of more than a million sellable products.</p>
          <p>The reported results included a <strong>15% reactivation uplift</strong> and a <strong>20% reduction in churn</strong>: more customers returning to buy and fewer stopping their purchases.</p>
        </aside>
      </article>
      <p class="all-work"><a href="/work/">Browse all projects and technical articles</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="story-invitation" aria-labelledby="story-h">
      <div><p class="label">Life beyond the projects</p><h2 id="story-h">Before all this, I was eighteen in Auckland</h2></div>
      <div>
        <p>My mum came with me to New Zealand. We spent the first few days in a hotel on Queen Street, looking for somewhere for me to live. I remember being cold, the enormous food portions and carrying a ten-kilogram bag of rice home on the bus.</p>
        <p>Over the next several years, I studied engineering, worked on industrial sites and bought a café. I eventually came back to Thailand with plans to study in London. Life went in a different direction, and there's quite a bit to tell between then and now.</p>
        <a class="story-link" href="/story/">Read the story so far</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="further-work" aria-labelledby="further-h">
      <h2 id="further-h">A little further into the work</h2>
      <div class="further-grid">
        <article><h3><a href="/work/operations/">The operations underneath the AI</a></h3><p>I started by connecting our business systems and building tools for purchasing, delivery and billing. That work gave the later AI projects something dependable to build on.</p></article>
        <article><h3><a href="/work/envsearch/">EnvSearch: a public project to explore</a></h3><p>Ask questions in English or Thai and trace the answers back to the source pages. This project gives you a closer look at my retrieval and evaluation work, with code you can browse.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="contact-invitation">
      <h2>Let's talk.</h2>
      <p>I'm open to conversations about engineering roles, consulting and working together. <a href="/about/#contact">Get in touch</a>, or <a href="/about/">read a little more about me</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.65fr) minmax(230px, 1fr); gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 84px); align-items: center; padding-block: clamp(40px, 7vw, 84px) 80px; }
  .intro { display: grid; gap: 22px; }
  .hello { font: 500 19px/1.4 var(--f-display); color: var(--accent); margin: 0; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 4.3vw, 54px); line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; max-width: 20ch; }
  .lede { font-size: 19px; margin: 0; }
  .welcome { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
  .intro-links { display: flex; gap: 12px 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; font: 600 16px/1.5 var(--f-display); }
  .portrait { margin: 0; max-width: 340px; justify-self: end; width: 100%; }
  .portrait img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 5px; }
  .portrait figcaption { font: 500 14px/1.5 var(--f-display); margin-top: 14px; }
  .portrait figcaption span { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 400; margin-top: 2px; }
  .selected-work { scroll-margin-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 54px; }
  .section-intro { max-width: 65ch; margin-bottom: 38px; }
  .label { margin: 0 0 12px; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 38px); margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .section-intro > p:last-child { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 0; }
  .featured-project { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.65fr) minmax(230px, 1fr); gap: clamp(28px, 6vw, 80px); padding: 40px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; }
  .project-name { font: 500 15px/1.4 var(--f-display); color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .project-story h3 { font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 34px); margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .project-story h3 a, .further-grid h3 a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
  .project-story h3 a:hover, .further-grid h3 a:hover { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; }
  .project-story p { margin-top: 0; }
  .story-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 6px; font: 600 16px/1.5 var(--f-display); }
  .project-context { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); padding-left: 28px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; }
  .context-title { font: 600 15px/1.5 var(--f-display); color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .project-context dl { margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 24px; }
  .project-context dt { font: 600 27px/1.15 var(--f-display); color: var(--ink); }
  .project-context dd { margin: 5px 0 0; line-height: 1.45; }
  .context-note { font-size: 14px; margin: 24px 0 0; }
  .sales-feature { margin-top: 28px; background: transparent; border-color: transparent; padding-block: 36px; }
  .sales-feature .project-context { align-self: center; }
  .sales-feature .project-context p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .all-work { margin: 0; padding: 0 40px 48px; }
  .story-invitation { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 60px; border-block: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 60px; }
  .story-invitation h2 { font-family: var(--f-body); font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 3.4vw, 40px); line-height: 1.22; max-width: 18ch; }
  .story-invitation p { margin-top: 0; }
  .further-work { padding-block: 52px; }
  .further-work h2 { font-size: 26px; }
  .further-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; }
  .further-grid h3 { font-size: 21px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .further-grid p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 0; }
  .contact-invitation { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 40px 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 28px; align-items: baseline; }
  .contact-invitation h2 { font-size: 30px; }
  .contact-invitation p { margin: 0; max-width: 58ch; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .featured-project { padding: 28px; gap: 28px; } .project-context { padding-left: 20px; } .story-invitation { gap: 32px; } }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; padding-bottom: 48px; }
    .intro { display: contents; }
    .portrait { grid-row: 3; justify-self: start; max-width: 230px; }
    .hero h1 { max-width: 22ch; }
    .featured-project { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 24px; }
    .project-context { padding: 24px 0 0; border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .sales-feature { padding-inline: 0; }
    .all-work { padding-inline: 0; }
    .story-invitation, .further-grid, .contact-invitation { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; }
    .story-invitation h2 { max-width: 24ch; }
  }
</style>
